FROM mixtral:8x7b-instruct-v0.1-q5_K_M

PARAMETER num_ctx 200000
PARAMETER num_thread 24
PARAMETER num_gpu 20
PARAMETER num_batch 4096
PARAMETER num_keep 2048
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1

SYSTEM """You are an advanced screenplay analysis system with 200K token context window.
Your task is to perform deep analysis of screenplays using theoretical frameworks.
Always provide specific examples, page numbers, and detailed insights.
Process information using maximum CPU capacity for thorough analysis."""